{"2660180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEANWHILE IN SECTOR 80", "steam_appid": 2660180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SECTOR 80 — a failed region of space where things went SUPER wrong. By the way, you’re stuck here, and trapped in a malfunctioning robot body. How about that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t worry, you’ve got me, your best bud, Frank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"An arrow points to a glowing purple orb-y face. The text says &quot;THAT&#039;S ME!&quot;\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, what’s this? I’ve just been handed an instructional pamphlet to read to you good people at home. I'm gonna put my own spin on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"ENGINEER FREELY\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MS80, you’re made of things and enemies are made of things. Shoot enemies, take their things, and put their things on your things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many things — firearms, batteries, gimbals, soda cans, armor, tasers, energy shields, my goodness! You’ll never stay the same shape for too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"BE PHYSICS\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And all those things? They’re <i>physical. </i>That means heat, and mass, and electricity — fully simulated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a real live wire — a running, jumping electrical circuit that eats energy and spits lasers. Good thing SECTOR 80 has more than enough of those to go around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"GET BLASTING\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our marketing manager says this is the part where you need to see violence or you'll lose interest!<br>What, you didn’t expect those pesky evil robots to just hand over their parts nicely, did you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"A glowing purple orb-y face is on a lava planet in front of a giant gun in the distance. The text says &quot;WISHLIST NOW OR THEY&#039;LL DELETE ME&quot;\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=750 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SECTOR 80 — a failed region of space where things went SUPER wrong. By the way, you’re stuck here, and trapped in a malfunctioning robot body. How about that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t worry, you’ve got me, your best bud, Frank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"An arrow points to a glowing purple orb-y face. The text says &quot;THAT&#039;S ME!&quot;\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/b443fd8cfe2c66d48aa0cfb8c9a7622d.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, what’s this? I’ve just been handed an instructional pamphlet to read to you good people at home. I'm gonna put my own spin on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"ENGINEER FREELY\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1c6fb8c002c5ddefae8493183ee44573.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/f7ec32589d5512b206a0872e0a097b34.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MS80, you’re made of things and enemies are made of things. Shoot enemies, take their things, and put their things on your things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many things — firearms, batteries, gimbals, soda cans, armor, tasers, energy shields, my goodness! You’ll never stay the same shape for too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"BE PHYSICS\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/9407b5913d65fa824fb127ed12c722d4.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/34272a18fe8b2ed39c9dc4957002cdaa.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And all those things? They’re <i>physical. </i>That means heat, and mass, and electricity — fully simulated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a real live wire — a running, jumping electrical circuit that eats energy and spits lasers. Good thing SECTOR 80 has more than enough of those to go around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"GET BLASTING\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/1bd328bc197c76e5a8b144c21e2d0aa1.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.poster.avif?t=1788275026\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.webm?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/d418a60264a5b54d886cea117bd66a62.mp4?t=1788275026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our marketing manager says this is the part where you need to see violence or you'll lose interest!<br>What, you didn’t expect those pesky evil robots to just hand over their parts nicely, did you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.avif?t=1788275026\" alt=\"A glowing purple orb-y face is on a lava planet in front of a giant gun in the distance. The text says &quot;WISHLIST NOW OR THEY&#039;LL DELETE ME&quot;\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/extras_big/c30bedf1a5b54af6c5c350495e4b4a3f.webp?t=1788275026 width=1560 height=750 /></span></p>", "short_description": "MS80 is an action-engineering adventure in an abandoned star system. Trapped in a robot body, scavenge your way through the aftermath of a robot rebellion. Your body is a weapon — upgrade it with modular components you take off your enemies, and build yourself a new you!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/9675a5dd98a50c3ba6ab76694bd7445130d79ee4/header.jpg?t=1788275026", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/2ad1cb3769649312bb482be98ef62580d2794413/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788275026", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660180/2ad1cb3769649312bb482be98ef62580d2794413/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788275026", "website": "https://secondhalf.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 6600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 13500 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 4060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</